  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "I have been…",
     "texto": [
      "To say how long an ongoing activity has been going on, the accusative of duration without a preposition is usually used: **Я работаю здесь два года** («I have been working here for two years»). With **год**, the form depends on the number: **один год**, **два–четыре года**, **пять лет**; **11–14 лет** is an exception.",
      "**Уже** can stress that the situation continues: **Я работаю здесь уже два года**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "From... to...",
     "texto": [
      "**С ... до ...** shows the start and the end: **с утра до вечера** («from morning till evening»), **с понедельника до пятницы** («from Monday to Friday»). **В течение + genitive** means «during»: **в течение дня** («during the day»).",
      "**Давно** means «for a long time» or «a long time ago», depending on the verb and context: **Я давно знаю его** («I have known him for a long time»). **Недавно** means «recently»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
